 "insight": [
  "The value per kilogram of Luxembourg's fuel imports increased from 0.40 euros in 2005 to 0.79 euros in 2025.",
  "Over this period, the value per kilogram rose by 96.1 percent, with a median value of 0.58 euros per kilogram between 2005 and 2025.",
  "The largest year-to-year increase occurred between 2021 and 2022, when the value jumped from 0.60 to 0.87 euros per kilogram.",
  "The peak value was reached in 2023 at 0.93 euros per kilogram, before slightly decreasing in 2024 to 0.89 euros per kilogram.",
  "These figures only include trade data where quantities are known, so some volumes and unit values may be missing."
 ],
